  "narrative": {
    "text": "A financial 'COST MODEL' table with columns for Data Type, per user/CHC per month, per user/CHC per year, and All users/CHCs per month, per year and pilot. Rows cover categories such as Incoming SMS, Outgoing SMS (with sub-items for reminders and query responses to patients and nurses), GPRS usage in KB (patient encounter forms, error exchanges, nurse queries), and Voice minutes incoming and outgoing (patient-provider messages, call centre registrations, nurse and user support). A highlighted TOTAL COST row gives per-month/per-year/pilot figures of 3,522 / 42,262 / 44,998. A bottom 'Assumptions' section gives the average cost per SMS (incoming and outgoing) in GHS and USD.",
